---
// UseCasesSection.astro
---

<section class="section-wrapper usecases-section" id="use-cases">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-center">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Targeted Solutions</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Built for the way you work.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Maggo is designed for real everyday pain points, without forcing you to re-architect how you use your Mac.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="usecases-grid">
      <!-- Use Case 1 -->
      <div class="usecase-card">
        <div class="usecase-icon-box">📥</div>
        <h3 class="usecase-audience">People with messy Downloads folders</h3>
        <div class="usecase-flow">
          <span class="flow-action">Download something.</span>
          <span class="flow-arrow">&darr;</span>
          <span class="flow-action highlight">Move it where it belongs (⌘⇧M).</span>
          <span class="flow-arrow">&darr;</span>
          <span class="flow-action">Keep going.</span>
        </div>
        <p class="usecase-description">
          Never let your Downloads folder become a chaotic graveyard again. Pick files, trigger Move To, and file them into archives instantly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Use Case 2 -->
      <div class="usecase-card">
        <div class="usecase-icon-box">🗂️</div>
        <h3 class="usecase-audience">People who work across multiple projects</h3>
        <div class="usecase-flow single-line">
          <span>Keep several project locations open in tabs (⌘T).</span>
        </div>
        <p class="usecase-description">
          Instead of scattering 8 Finder windows across multiple virtual desktops, keep active repositories, design assets, and invoices neatly arranged in tabs within one unified window.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Use Case 3 -->
      <div class="usecase-card">
        <div class="usecase-icon-box">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="usecase-audience">People who constantly move files</h3>
        <div class="usecase-flow single-line">
          <span>Move To • Copy To • Keyboard Shortcuts • Split View</span>
        </div>
        <p class="usecase-description">
          No mouse fatigue. Select with arrow keys, press ⌘⇧M to fuzzy search destination, or press ⌘⇧S to drag between side-by-side panes with 100% precision.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Use Case 4 -->
      <div class="usecase-card">
        <div class="usecase-icon-box">💾</div>
        <h3 class="usecase-audience">People who work with external drives</h3>
        <div class="usecase-flow single-line">
          <span>Navigate local and external storage from the same interface.</span>
        </div>
        <p class="usecase-description">
          Mounted SSDs, USB sticks, and SD cards appear front-and-center in the sidebar alongside live storage capacity gauges and instant eject controls.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Use Case 5 -->
      <div class="usecase-card usecase-wide">
        <div class="usecase-icon-box">🎯</div>
        <div class="usecase-wide-content">
          <h3 class="usecase-audience">People who simply don't like Finder</h3>
          <div class="usecase-quote">
            "You don't need a complicated reason. Sometimes you just want a better file manager."
          </div>
          <p class="usecase-description">
            Finder was designed for general consumer computing. Maggo is built specifically for users who value speed, intentional organization, and predictable daily productivity.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .usecases-section {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .section-header-center {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .usecases-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .usecases-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .usecase-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .usecase-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    border-color: #CBD5E1;
  }

  .usecase-wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .usecase-wide {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  .usecase-icon-box {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .usecase-wide .usecase-icon-box {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .usecase-wide-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .usecase-audience {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .usecase-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .usecase-flow.single-line {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .flow-action.highlight {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .flow-arrow {
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .usecase-quote {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .usecase-description {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
